    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/prime-tutor-academy/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Prime Tutor Academy is a premium, feature-packed theme tailored for private tutoring services, academic coaching, virtual classrooms, and personalized education platforms. Designed to meet the diverse needs of tutor academies, homeschooling support programs, after-school tutoring centers, and online tutoring businesses, it provides an exceptional framework for educators in every niche—math tutors, science tutors, English tutors, SAT/ACT prep tutors, and more. Whether you're offering K-12 tutoring, high school subject coaching, skill-based learning, or college entrance exam preparation, this theme helps you deliver structured learning experiences across disciplines like IELTS, TOEFL, coding, robotics, business studies, and language acquisition. Equipped to support group tutoring sessions, one-on-one mentorship, university admissions coaching, and study skills development, it also caters to professional career counseling, special education tutoring, and educational consultancies. The theme features a sleek, mobile-responsive layout with customizable banners, tutor profiles, interactive course listings, and intuitive scheduling tools via Contact Form 7 integration. With built-in call-to-action sections, secure payment support, and seamless social media connectivity, it’s ideal for managing tutoring franchises, e-learning startups, academic success programs, and digital education hubs. Whether you run an individual tutoring service or a large-scale academy, this conversion-optimized, visually engaging solution empowers educators to attract students, deliver results, and grow their online presence."
    },
